Apple this week introduced an all-new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/apple-announces-homeview-smart-home-hub/">HomeView smart home hub</a>, but popular tech reviewer Marques Brownlee is "not convinced" about it.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/HomeView-Music.jpeg" alt="" width="1280" height="720" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1071016" /><br/>
In his <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QVv3mQzlrN0">HomeView impressions video</a> on his YouTube channel MKBHD, Brownlee said "I cannot figure any group that this is actually ideal for."<br/>
<br/>
HomeView has a lot of overlap with other Apple devices, including the iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, and HomePod. Brownlee said the HomeView does not provide enough "extra value," leading him to believe that the device should be "a skip for most people."<br/>
